7,Huautla Mazatec – TIPs,https://tips.translation.bible/tip_language/mau/,"Huautla Mazatec (mau) is a(n) Otomanguean language of Mexico, marked as threatened.“ask in front of God” (Huautla Mazatec). “ask you by God” (Eastern Highland Otomi). “ask you in God’s presence” (Southern Subanen).","Mazatec, Huautla",Otomanguean
