9,"Mazatec, Huautla Language (MAU)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/mau/,Huautla Mazatec is a stable indigenous language of Mexico. It belongs to the Otomanguean language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Mazatec, Huautla",Otomanguean
